---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { accountSyncV2Enabled as isAccountSyncV2Enabled } from '../../lib/account-v2/feature-flags';

const accountSyncV2Enabled = isAccountSyncV2Enabled({
  PUBLIC_ACCOUNT_SYNC_V2_ENABLED: process.env.PUBLIC_ACCOUNT_SYNC_V2_ENABLED,
  PUBLIC_ACCOUNT_SYNC_V2_PREVIEW_ACK: process.env.PUBLIC_ACCOUNT_SYNC_V2_PREVIEW_ACK,
});
const updated = '29 September 2026';
const modifiedAt = '2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z';

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@type': 'WebPage',
    name: 'Terms of use — Zodiacs.org',
    url: 'https://zodiacs.org/terms/',
    description:
      'Terms for using Zodiacs.org astrology tools, saved charts, Registry records, and the optional Astrofolio Jupiter convenience tool.',
    dateModified: modifiedAt,
  },
];
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use | Zodiacs.org"
  description="Terms for using Zodiacs.org astrology tools, saved charts, Registry records, and the optional Astrofolio Jupiter convenience tool."
  path="/terms/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <section class="section container container--narrow">
    <em class="kicker">Terms</em>
    <h1 class="method-title display">Terms of use.</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        These Terms of Use are an agreement between you and{' '}
        <strong>Zodiacs LLC</strong>, a New Mexico limited liability company
        (“Zodiacs,” “we,” “us,” or “our”). Zodiacs LLC owns and operates
        Zodiacs.org. The site is a free astrology reference with a Registry wing
        whose records, catalogue profiles, SDK, and verification tools are
        read-only. A separate, optional Astrofolio convenience tool can request
        a quote from Jupiter and hand a proposed transaction to your own wallet
        after you explicitly load it. Zodiacs does not take custody or sign for
        you. Using the site means you agree to these terms. We have tried to keep
        them short and readable.
      </p>

      <h2>The Cabinet of Twelve and wallet connections</h2>
      <p>
        The Cabinet of Twelve is an optional symbolic display that reads a locally
        saved birth-chart summary, the public record of one wallet address, and
        dated sky information side by side. It is a Zodiacs.org display
        convention, not a traditional astrological technique, proof about a
        person, wallet score, price prediction, or recommendation. The wallet
        record does not change the birth chart, and no purchase is required.
      </p>
      <p>
        Aura accepts a pasted public address or, after your click, asks
        compatible third-party wallet software for public accounts you
        authorize. Aura uses one compatible address for its lookup and does not
        request or need a recovery phrase, private key, message signature, token
        approval, transaction, or network switch. Pasted addresses may belong
        to anyone. A connection or lookup does not prove control of an address,
        legal ownership of an asset, or a person's identity.
      </p>

      <h2>What “official” means in the Registry</h2>
      <p>
        On Zodiacs.org, “official,” “official Zodiac,” and similar wording mean
        only that an address, contract, mint, or representation matches an
        entry in the Zodiacs.org Registry's published canonical list. This is a
        Registry classification—not approval by a government, regulator,
        wallet provider, marketplace, or blockchain; not identity verification;
        and not a promise of authenticity beyond that list, safety, value,
        scarcity, liquidity, or future performance. Verify important details
        independently on-chain.
      </p>

      <h2>Digital-asset risks and third-party routes</h2>
      <p>
        Digital assets can be highly speculative and volatile. They may have no
        buyers, become illiquid, fall to zero market value, or result in a total
        loss. Other risks include counterfeit assets, scams, malicious
        approvals, software or smart-contract defects, network disruption,
        inaccurate or delayed market data, provider or venue failure, loss of
        wallet access, and changes in law or regulation. Past activity, rarity,
        Registry status, an Aura reading, or displayed market context does not
        predict value or reduce those risks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Explorer and other external links lead to independent third parties
        with their own terms, fees, security, and privacy practices. Catalogue
        profiles and Registry lookups contain no purchase route or trading link.
        On the separate <a href="/astrofolio/how-to-buy/">Astrofolio How to Buy</a>{' '}
        page, an optional tool loads only after your click and eligibility
        confirmation. Jupiter supplies the quote, constructs the proposed
        transaction, and receives the signed transaction for submission. Your
        independent wallet displays the transaction and signs locally only if
        you approve it. Zodiacs.org does not execute or broker the trade, never
        receives your recovery phrase or private key, holds no keys or funds,
        cannot reverse a transaction, and receives no referral, platform,
        liquidity, or marketplace compensation for any trade reached through
        the site. Blockchain transactions are often irreversible. Check the
        network, official address, amount, fees, and destination before signing.
      </p>
      <p>
        The optional tool is not available to everyone or lawful in every
        jurisdiction. Use it only if you are legally eligible where you live,
        meet any age requirement that applies to you, and may use Jupiter and
        your wallet under their terms. Do not load or use it where digital-asset
        swaps are prohibited or restricted for you. Zodiacs.org does not make
        an eligibility determination for you.
      </p>
      <p>
        A link or Registry entry is provided for reference and is not an
        endorsement, solicitation, or statement that an asset is suitable for
        you. The <a href="/disclosure/">Registry disclosure</a> labels each
        statement as verified from public evidence or as a dated operator
        attestation; an attestation is the operator's own statement and must
        not be treated as independently verified.
      </p>

      <h2>What this site is</h2>
      <p>
        Zodiacs.org computes astronomical positions and presents astrological
        interpretations, guides, and tools. Astrology is offered here for
        interest, reflection, and entertainment. It is not a substitute for
        professional advice — medical, psychological, legal, or financial — and
        nothing on the site should be treated as a prediction of future events
        or as a basis for important decisions. The astronomy is computed
        carefully (see the <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a>); the
        interpretation of it remains a tradition, not a science.
      </p>

      <h2>Free use</h2>
      <p>
        The calculators, guides, and reading tools are free to use for your own
        personal, non-commercial purposes. You may share links to pages freely.
        The embeddable sky widget may be used under the short terms stated on
        the <a href="/widgets/">widgets page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Accounts</h2>
      {accountSyncV2Enabled ? (
        <p>
          An account is optional. If you create one, keep access to its email
          secure and synchronize only a chart containing your own birth data.
          The current canary permits one self chart and requires an explicit
          review and confirmation before upload. The canary is limited to users
          aged 18 or older. You may export or permanently
          delete the account from your profile. Account deletion also attempts
          to stop the independently confirmed Daily Sun subscription linked to
          the same email; if that match cannot be confirmed, account erasure
          still completes and you will receive manual unsubscribe instructions.
          Deleting an account does not cancel an Apple subscription if one is
          introduced later. We may suspend accounts used to abuse the service
          or others.
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>
          An account is optional. If you create one, you are responsible for the
          email address you use and for the charts you choose to save and sync.
          Keep access to your email secure, since sign-in happens through it. You
          may delete your account at any time by emailing{' '}
          <a href="mailto:admin@zodiacs.org">admin@zodiacs.org</a>. We may suspend
          accounts used to abuse the service or others.
        </p>
      )}
      <p>
        Living Chart is optional. You may keep entries only on a device or grant
        a separate account-sync permission so they follow you across devices.
        Do not place information in a Living Chart note that you do not want
        stored with your account. You may edit or delete individual entries,
        export the timeline, or withdraw Living Chart sync from the profile
        controls. Living Chart and horoscope material is for reflection and
        entertainment, not a prediction or professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        Please do not attempt to break, overload, scrape at scale, or misuse the
        site or its infrastructure, and do not use it to harass others or to
        break the law. The registry wing and developer SDK have their own
        read-only, no-advice character, described within those pages.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2>
      <p>
        We work to compute positions accurately and test them against reference
        data, but the site is provided <strong>as is</strong> and{' '}
        <strong>as available</strong>, without warranties of any kind. We do not
        guarantee that it will be uninterrupted, error-free, or fit for a
        particular purpose. Sky data covers a bounded range of years and is
        refreshed periodically. Registry, holdings, provider, and market data
        may be delayed, incomplete, or unavailable and should be independently
        verified before any consequential action.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent the law allows, Zodiacs LLC and the people who run
        Zodiacs.org are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential
        loss arising from your use of the site, third-party services, wallet
        software, or decisions made in reliance on site content. This includes
        loss of digital assets, value, access, data, or opportunity. Because the
        service is free and interpretive, you use it at your own discretion.
      </p>

      <h2>Content and intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site's original text, design, and code belong to Zodiacs LLC unless
        noted otherwise. City data is from{' '}
        <a href="https://www.geonames.org/" rel="noopener noreferrer">GeoNames</a>{' '}
        under CC BY 4.0, and the fonts are used under the SIL Open Font License;
        both are credited in the footer. The chart calculations carry 32 values
        of ΔT, rounded to 0.01 seconds, from Table S15 of Stephenson, Morrison
        and Hohenkerk, "Measurement of the Earth's rotation: 720 BC to AD 2015",{' '}
        <a href="https://doi.org/10.1098/rspa.2016.0404" rel="noopener noreferrer">Proceedings of the Royal Society A 472, 20160404</a>{' '}
        (2016), published under{' '}
        <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY 4.0</a>.
        You are welcome to quote and link to pages with attribution.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms as the site evolves. When we do, we will
        change the date below. Continuing to use the site after a change means
        you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Operator and applicable law</h2>
      <p>
        Zodiacs LLC, a limited liability company formed under New Mexico law, is
        the operator of Zodiacs.org. These terms apply subject to the mandatory
        laws and non-waivable rights that govern your use of the site, including
        consumer rights that apply where you live. Nothing in these terms limits
        rights or remedies that cannot lawfully be waived.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms may be sent to Zodiacs LLC at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:admin@zodiacs.org">admin@zodiacs.org</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="method-updated mono">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .method-title { margin: 6px 0 8px; }
  .prose .lede { font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text); }
  .method-updated { margin-top: 40px; color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
</style>
